irus you need to  look at the the whole of what's  happening here in canada uh around the  world uh looking very uh i i would say  in depth at sort of the the changes in  the in the the in the virus not just  quote an individual sub-variant but  maybe you know what might be a major  change or be in the spike protein or you  know other uh  other factors that might uh you know uh  lead towards uh having a let's say  another sort of uh you know formulation  of the vaccine so that's what i would  say is sort of the big picture moving  forward  recognizing that the virus will continue  to evolve and  as  as such the vaccines will also continue  to evolve to keep up in offering  canadians and others around the world  the best possible protection

